# Normalise line endings so every clone sees LF, on Windows included.
#
# This is load-bearing, not cosmetic. The front-matter parsers in scripts/ read
# `key: value` pairs; with CRLF checkouts a Windows clone silently produced bundles
# containing zero commands and zero personas, because every description parsed as absent.
# The parsers now tolerate CRLF as well, but normalising here stops the class of bug.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.md   text eol=lf
*.mjs  text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.php  text eol=lf
